    {
      "kind": "ability",
      "name": "Claw of Pain",
      "category": "offensive",
      "text": "When Sister Endreah targets the same creature with two Strikes from her Flurry of Blows, she can cause lingering pain. If either Strike hits and deals damage, the target must succeed at a DC 21 Fortitude save save or take 1d4 persistent,mental damage (and become Sickened 1 on a critical failure)."
    },
